WEBVTT

00:11:58.794 --> 00:12:01.136
We clamped down on corruption,

00:12:02.112 --> 00:12:06.247
closed up the loopholes
for fraud and waste,

00:12:06.271 --> 00:12:09.976
and we watched the money build up.

00:12:10.569 --> 00:12:14.035
We successfully launched
a free, quality education program

00:12:14.059 --> 00:12:15.534
in August last year,

00:12:15.558 --> 00:12:17.618
four years, four months later.

00:12:18.396 --> 00:12:21.909
Today, two million children
are going to school.

00:12:22.432 --> 00:12:28.321
(Applause)

00:12:28.732 --> 00:12:31.063
Twenty-one percent of the national budget